  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/main/extension/icons/icon128.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Zed Space 标志\" />\n  <h1>Zed Space Skin</h1>\n  <p>Zed Space Skin · DeepSeek Harness 动态背景与界面皮肤。原生个性化动态背景皮肤，以及市场下载精美的动态壁纸。</p>\n  <p><strong>简体中文</strong> · <a href=\"README.en.md\">English</a></p>\n</div>\n\n**1.0.2 · 技术包名 `dsh-zed-space`。** 下载安装入口与市场收录进度见[发布记录](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/publishing/releases/1.0.2.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "[源代码](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space) · [安装说明](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/install.zh.md) · [问题反馈](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/issues)\n\n本项目是 DeepSeek Harness 的社区插件，不是 DeepSeek 官方产品，也不适用于 DeepSeek 网页聊天站点。"
    },
    {
      "section": "当前功能",
      "text": "| 场景或功能 | 可以做什么 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 实时海洋 | 调节波浪、日光，或启用自动昼夜变化。 |\n| 宇宙双视角 | 在地平线和漩涡视角间切换，分别调整光晕、星点与运动参数。 |\n| 每场景参数 | 各场景保存自己的参数和玻璃浓度；可单独调整对话面板背景。 |\n| 在线壁纸市场 | 浏览、预览和下载动态壁纸，保存到「我的视频」后应用。 |\n| 本地视频库 | 多选导入、缩略图列表、勾选启用一个、重命名和移除，重新打开后恢复。 |\n| 平滑切换 | 新画面就绪后交叠过渡；宇宙双视角在同一个渲染器内切换。 |"
    },
    {
      "section": "当前功能",
      "text": "单个视频上限为 **32 MiB、30 秒、1080p**，支持范围及存储说明见[本地视频背景](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/video-background.md)。素材保存在本机，不会自动上传或随浏览器账号同步。**已接入[Zed Space 公网壁纸市场](https://zed-space.ai-cove.com/wallpapers)**：在「本地视频」中点击「发现官方精美动态皮肤」，即可搜索、预览和下载；校验入库后再显式应用。使用方式与网络范围见[壁纸市场接入](docs/market-integration.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "场景展示",
      "text": "以下五张截图来自 **DeepSeek Harness Web 0.2.1-rc.3** 的真实运行界面，安装的是 `dsh-zed-space@1.0.0`。截图使用独立临时 profile，展示当前壁纸的配置面板：玻璃不透明度为最低值 **40%**，开启对话面板独立调整并设为 **60%**。图片已压缩；[截图环境、参数与素材来源](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/screenshots/README.md)均有记录。"
    },
    {
      "section": "本地视频 · 深蓝潜行",
      "text": "两段视频通过「本地视频」导入并实际播放，仅作效果展示，不随插件分发。"
    },
    {
      "section": "安装",
      "text": "在 Harness 的「插件 → 添加插件」中输入 `dsh-zed-space@1.0.2`。Harness Web 可运行：\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-zed-space@1.0.2\n```\n\n也可从 [GitHub Release](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/releases/tag/v1.0.2) 下载 `dsh-zed-space-1.0.2.tgz`，将本地文件路径填入安装命令。安装后重启对应的 Harness 实例。\n\n从 Backspace 升级时，先在同一 profile 卸载旧插件，再安装新包；保留原有配置与视频数据。详见[安装与迁移](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/install.zh.md)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "本地构建与预览",
      "text": "需要 Node.js 20+。在仓库目录运行：\n\n```sh\nnpm ci\nnpm run build\nnpm run build:site\nnpm test\n\n`pages-dist/` 是官网静态产物，可通过本地 HTTP 服务预览。Pages 工作流只保留手动触发，不随 npm 或 GitHub Release 自动发布。\n\n开发者接入方式见[插件构建说明](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/dsh-plugin.md)和[源码集成](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/harness-plugin/README.md)。旧版迁移注意事项见[安装说明](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/install.zh.md)，不要删除整个 Harness 配置或会话目录。"
    },
    {
      "section": "常见问题",
      "text": "**现在能从 npm 或市场安装新版吗？**\n\n可按上方精确版本或 Release 文件安装。社区目录已收录，客户端索引按各市场的计划同步；各渠道状态见[发布记录](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/publishing/releases/1.0.2.md)。\n\n**有共享壁纸市场吗？**\n\n有。[Zed Space 壁纸市场](https://zed-space.ai-cove.com/wallpapers)已上线，DSH 插件可在画廊内浏览、下载到「我的视频」并应用，无需启动本地市场服务。已保存的视频可离线使用，详见[壁纸市场接入](docs/market-integration.md)。\n\n**历史 Backspace 内容为什么还在？**"
    },
    {
      "section": "常见问题",
      "text": "本项目从 Backspace 演进而来。历史变更记录和旧媒体保留溯源用途。当前仓库的 Git tag 从 `v1.0.0` 重新开始。上游作者和许可记录见 [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md) 与 [LICENSE](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/LICENSE)。"
    },
    {
      "section": "开发资料",
      "text": "[变更记录](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) · [贡献指南](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) · [隐私说明](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/privacy.md) · [安全政策](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/SECURITY.md)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/main/extension/icons/icon128.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" alt=\"Zed Space mark\" />\n  <h1>Zed Space Skin</h1>\n  <p>Zed Space Skin · Dynamic backgrounds and interface skins for DeepSeek Harness. Native customizable animated skins, plus beautiful live wallpapers to download from the marketplace.</p>\n  <p><a href=\"README.md\">简体中文</a> · <strong>English</strong></p>\n</div>"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "**1.0.2 · Package name: `dsh-zed-space`.** See the [release record](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/publishing/releases/1.0.2.md) for downloads and marketplace review status.\n\n[Source](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space) · [Installation](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/dsh-plugin.md) · [Issues](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/issues)"
    },
    {
      "section": "Introduction",
      "text": "This is an independent community plugin for DeepSeek Harness, not an official DeepSeek product or a skin for the DeepSeek web chat site."
    },
    {
      "section": "Current features",
      "text": "| Scene or feature | What it does |\n| --- | --- |\n| Live ocean | Adjust waves and daylight, or enable the automatic day cycle. |\n| Two cosmic views | Switch between horizon and vortex, with separate glow, stars, and motion settings. |\n| Per-scene settings | Keep scene parameters and glass opacity; optionally adjust the conversation background independently. |\n| Wallpaper marketplace | Browse, preview, and download live wallpapers, then apply them from My Videos. |\n| Local video library | Import multiple files, view thumbnails, enable one video, rename, remove, and restore after reopening. |\n| Smooth transitions | Wait for the next frame before blending; both cosmic views transition within one renderer. |"
    },
    {
      "section": "Current features",
      "text": "Each video is limited to **32 MiB, 30 seconds, and 1080p**. See [local video background](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/video-background.md) for formats and storage details. Media stays on the device and is not automatically uploaded or synced through a browser account. **The plugin connects to the public [Zed Space wallpaper market](https://zed-space.ai-cove.com/wallpapers).** Open “Discover official animated skins” from “Local video” to browse, preview, and download; applying a downloaded video is a separate action. See [marketplace integration](docs/market-integration.md) for usage and network details."
    },
    {
      "section": "Scene gallery",
      "text": "These five screenshots were captured in the real **DeepSeek Harness Web 0.2.1-rc.3** application with `dsh-zed-space@1.0.0` installed in a separate temporary profile. Each image shows the active wallpaper’s settings: glass opacity at its minimum of **40%**, with independent conversation opacity enabled at **60%**. The PNGs are compressed without resizing. See the [capture environment, settings, and media sources](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/screenshots/README.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Local video · deep dive",
      "text": "Both videos were imported through the local video library and played in the application. They are demonstration media and are not included with the plugin."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "In Harness, open Plugins → Add plugin and enter `dsh-zed-space@1.0.2`. For Harness Web:\n\n```sh\ndsh plugin --profile web add dsh-zed-space@1.0.2\n```\n\nAlternatively, download `dsh-zed-space-1.0.2.tgz` from the [GitHub Release](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/releases/tag/v1.0.2) and install using its local path. Restart the corresponding Harness instance after installation."
    },
    {
      "section": "Installation",
      "text": "When upgrading from Backspace, remove the old plugin from the same profile before adding the new one. Keep your settings and video data. See [installation and migration](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/install.zh.md)."
    },
    {
      "section": "Build and preview locally",
      "text": "Requires Node.js 20+. From the repository directory:\n\n```sh\nnpm ci\nnpm run build\nnpm run build:site\nnpm test\n\n`pages-dist/` contains the static website and can be previewed through a local HTTP server. Pages deployment is manual and does not run with npm or GitHub releases."
    },
    {
      "section": "Build and preview locally",
      "text": "See [plugin integration](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/dsh-plugin.md), [source integration](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/harness-plugin/README.md), and [migration notes](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/install.zh.md). Do not delete the entire Harness configuration or session directory."
    },
    {
      "section": "Common questions",
      "text": "**Can I install this version from npm or a marketplace?**\n\nUse the exact package version or Release file above. The community directory lists the plugin, while client indexes follow their own sync schedules. See the [release record](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/publishing/releases/1.0.2.md).\n\n**Is there a shared wallpaper marketplace?**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Common questions",
      "text": "Yes. The public [Zed Space wallpaper market](https://zed-space.ai-cove.com/wallpapers) lets you browse, download to “My videos,” and apply a video in DSH without running a local market server. Saved videos remain available offline. See [marketplace integration](docs/market-integration.md).\n\n**Why is historical Backspace content still present?**"
    },
    {
      "section": "Common questions",
      "text": "This project evolved from Backspace. Historical changelog entries and media remain for provenance. Git tags in the current repository restart at `v1.0.0`. See [THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md) and [LICENSE](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/LICENSE) for upstream authorship and licensing."
    },
    {
      "section": "Development",
      "text": "[Changelog](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md) · [Contributing](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md) · [Privacy](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/docs/privacy.md) · [Security](https://github.com/hetonghao/dsh-zed-space/blob/main/SECURITY.md)"
    }
